  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that the vectors are coplanar.</p><p>That means the determinant is equal to zero.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8211;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8211;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Expand the determinant along&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>[</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p>",
